      "Χρήση": "Απλώστε αρκετές σταγόνες ανάμεσα στις παλάμες και κάντε μασάζ σε μαλλιά και γένια. Αποφύγετε την επαφή με τα μάτια.",
      "Σύνθεση": "Οι νέες μας καινοτόμες φόρμουλες έχουν σχεδιαστεί ειδικά για τις ανάγκες της ανδρικής επιδερμίδας. Με ανάλαφρες υφές που εξασφαλίζουν εύκολη εφαρμογή και μέγιστη απορρόφηση, τα προϊόντα είναι ιδανικά για την ανδρική επιδερμίδα που συνήθως παρουσιάζει πιο τραχιά υφή. Η σειρά περιλαμβάνει τα απαραίτητα προϊόντα περιποίησης για μια ολοκληρωμένη ρουτίνα, με συνθέσεις εμπλουτισμένες με φυσικά μαλακτικά που λειαίνουν την επιδερμίδα. Επιπλέον, η δράση κατά της γυαλάδας βοηθά στην εξισορρόπηση της λιπαρότητας, ένα κοινό ζήτημα για τους άνδρες.\nΗ συλλογή διαθέτει επίσης δύο νέα αρώματα—μια εκλεκτική και εκλεπτυσμένη επιλογή από vintage, αρμονικά αρώματα, εμπνευσμένα από τη γοητεία των παλιών αθηναϊκών κουρείων.",
      "Περιγραφή (EN)": "Grooming Oil for Hair + Beard A grooming dry oil for hair and beard that softens and makes facial hair easy to comb and tame. Boosted with achillea millefolium extract rich in antioxidants, abyssinian, almond and olive oils, it nourishes and offers healthy-looking shine.\nAchillea Millefolium Extract + Extra Virgin Olive Oil\nSoften + Nourish\nDermatologically Tested\nMay contain traces of wheat / nuts\nC13-15 ALKANE, COCOGLYCERIDES, OCTYLDODECANOL, ISOAMYL LAURATE, COCO-CAPRYLATE, ALCOHOL DENAT., PRUNUS AMYGDALUS DULCIS (SWEET ALMOND) OIL, HYDROGENATED ETHYLHEXYL OLIVATE, CRAMBE ABYSSINICA SEED OIL, PARFUM/FRAGRANCE, ACHILLEA MILLEFOLIUM FLOWER EXTRACT, AQUA/WATER/EAU, ASCORBYL PALMITATE, ASCORBYL TETRAISOPALMITATE, ETHYL LINOLEATE, GLYCINE SOJA (SOYBEAN) OIL, HELIANTHUS ANNUUS (SUNFLOWER) SEED OIL, HYDROGENATED OLIVE OIL UNSAPONIFIABLES, LECITHIN, OLEA EUROPAEA (OLIVE) FRUIT OIL, TOCOPHEROL, TOCOPHERYL ACETATE, BETA-CARYOPHYLLENE, CITRUS AURANTIUM BERGAMIA PEEL OIL, COUMARIN, HEXADECANOLACTONE, JUNIPERUS VIRGINIANA OIL, LIMONENE, LINALOOL, LINALYL ACETATE, PINENE, POGOSTEMON CABLIN OIL.\n498 Achillea millefolium, commonly known as yarrow, is a native plant of Greece and one of the most widely used medicinal plants in the world. The genus Achillea is represented in Greece by approximately 32 species, with Achillea millefolium L. being the most studied species due to its long history of human use. Yarrow grows in temperate regions of the Northern Hemisphere as a perennial plant that blossoms from May to the end of summer\nIts cultivation is part of the ethical collaborations of KORRES, as it is organically cultivated and certified in cooperation with KETHEA Ithaki, the therapeutic program for the rehabilitation of addicted individuals.\n100 mL / 3.38 FL.OZ. Our new innovative formulas are designed to meet the specific needs of men's skin. With lightweight textures that ensure easy application and maximum absorption, these products are ideal for men’s thicker complexion. The range includes grooming essentials for a complete men’s routine, featuring skin-smoothing formulas enriched with natural emollients. Additionally, the anti-shine effect helps balance oiliness, a common concern for men.\nThe collection also introduces new fragrances—an eclectic and sophisticated selection of vintage, well-rounded, allergen-free scents, inspired by the charm of old Athenian barbershops.\nSuitable for Vegans Based on our deep understanding of herbs and expertise in innovative/green extraction methods, we have created an in-house, environmentally-friendly, certified Extraction Labin cooperation with “Pharmagnose”, a spin-off of the National and Kapodistrian University of Athens, Department of Pharmacy, Section of Pharmacognosy & Natural Products Chemistry.Our aim is to extract and isolate active herbal ingredients to produce clinically effective extracts of the highest quality. Through a 100% zero-waste process, we achieve high-quality extracts using exclusively natural solvents. The solid residue is composted, returning to the soil as organic fertilizer.\nOur Achillea millefolium extract has demonstrated high antioxidant capacity, rejuvenating the skin and improving its texture. This new KORRES extract which was developed in cooperation with “Pharmagnose”, a spin-off of the National and Kapodistrian University of Athens, was produced through a zero-waste process, using the Achillea millefolium plant, a product of organic agriculture, cultivated with respect for the environment in collaboration with KETHEA Ithaki.\nThe antioxidant-rich Achillea millefolium extract is the outcome of the 3-year long research project “CosmAGE” which teamed up the most prestigious University labs & scientific institutions in Greece to explore the cosmetic potential of 50 native plant species. The extracts from Achillea millefolium performed strong antioxidant activity based on the biological tests while the phytochemical analysis detected many bioactive compounds known for offering comfort to the skin from irritations caused by shaving while promoting rejuvenation by mitigating the formation of deep wrinkles, a prevalent issue in male skin.\nEvery element of the line is carefully crafted to bring the 'Athenian Grooming' heritage to life.\nIt all starts with packaging that features a premium, apothecary-inspired design.\nOur new packaging design prioritizes sustainability and innovation. We have introduced aluminum tubes, and 100% of our packaging is now fully recyclable. Additionally, all paper packaging is made from FSC-certified materials, ensuring responsible sourcing and environmental care.\nAt Korres we collect packaging waste and ensure it is transformed and reused. We wish to turn empties into beautiful recycled objects, offering them and us a second chance. Our Recycle Lab is fully operational in Greece, aspiring to expand across the globe.\nApply several drops between palms and massage into hair and beard. Avoid contact with eyes.\nSoftens & nourishes hair + beard from the 1st use*\n*8 in 10 men who tried KORRES Athenian Grooming Barber’s 4 in 1 Grooming Oil / Self-evaluation, 20 panelists between 35-55 years old.\n0 98.2% Natural Origin Content MEN SKINCARE true"
