    "sections": {
      "Χρήση": "Ψεκάστε απευθείας στην επιδερμίδα στα σημεία των παλμών (λαιμός, εσωτερικό καρπών / αγκώνων) και αφήστε να στεγνώσει αποφεύγοντας την τριβή για τη μέγιστη διάρκεια και απόδοση του αρώματος. Για εξωτερική χρήση μόνο.",
      "Σύνθεση": "Υψηλή αρωματοποιία. Πολύπλοκο αλλά και ισορροπημένο. Κλασικό αλλά και σύγχρονο. Με έμπνευση τα αρώματα της Μεσογείου και με βάση τα υψηλής ποιότητας συστατικά. Όλα τα παραπάνω συνθέτουν το χαρακτήρα του αρώματος KORRES. Αρωματικές πυραμίδες που έχουν δημιουργηθεί σε συνεργασία με αρωματοποιούς από όλο τον κόσμο. Φόρμουλες που έχουν αναπτυχθεί από το δικό μας Εργαστήριο Ανάπτυξης: με φυσικό αντιοξειδωτικό από δενδρολίβανο, χωρίς PCM, phthalates και nitro-musks.",
      "Περιγραφή (EN)": "Eau De Toilette Scent Identity: Fougere, Oriental\nEarth and water; fresh, yet bold. This fragrance reveals the art of balancing fresh oceanic notes with amber and cardamom, as they let energizing peppermint in. Cedar, black pepper and soft apple blossoms are the last notes to emerge out of this powerful fragrance.\nOceanic Amber: A fusion of wood, salt and fresh water; the essence of deep waters surrounded by strong, resinous trees; nature’s unpolished beauty appreciated since Neolithic times.\nCardamom: One of the most ancient and precious spices; its earliest attested form includes it in the list of ingredients used by ancient perfumers in the Mycenae palace.\nPeppermint: Greek nymph Minthe transformed into this sweet toned plant that released a powerful, energizing, fresh aroma each time it was stepped on. Among the oldest herbs used in medicine, peppermint has long been appreciated for its instant refreshing and energizing ability.\nTop Notes: Amber\nHeart Notes: Peppermint\nBase Notes: Cardamom\nSpray directly to skin on pulse points (neck, inside the wrists and elbows) and let dry without rubbing, for maximum duration. For external use only.\nALCOHOL DENAT., AQUA/WATER/EAU, PARFUM/ FRAGRANCE, BRASSICA CAMPESTRIS (RAPESEED) SEED OIL, HELIANTHUS ANNUUS (SUNFLOWER) SEED OIL, ROSMARINUS OFFICINALIS (ROSEMARY) LEAF EXTRACT, ALPHA-ISOMETHYL IONONE, CITRAL, COUMARIN, GERANIOL, HYDROXYCITRONELLAL, LIMONENE, LINALOOL. May contain traces of wheat / nuts\n778 50 mL / 1.69 FL. OZ.\nConscious yet premium. Complex yet balanced. Classic yet contemporary. Mediterranean-inspired. Fine ingredients-oriented. Dedicated to create fine perfumes with pure raw materials, working together with fragrance houses across the world. KORRES Fragrance is consciously made with natural antioxidant rosemary extract, without PCM, phthalates, and nitro-musks.\nEau De Toilette All skin types Pure Beauty Awards [UK], 2011, Best Self Select Fragrance, Silver Award Suitable for Vegans Eau De Toilette As light rays strike the brown transparent glass bottle, an intriguing dance of shadows and amber reflections catches the eye. Minimal design, soft around the edges with a lab-inspired white top, it feels like holding a fragrance bottle of another era; an ode to simplicity of timeless quality. Wrapped in an all-white box, that tells the story of each KORRES scent through its notes. We use 90% recyclable packaging across all our product lines.\nAt KORRES we collect packaging waste and ensure it is transformed and reused. We wish to turn empties into beautiful recycled objects, offering them and us a second chance. Our Recycle Lab is fully operational in Greece, aspiring to expand across the globe.\nSpray directly to skin on pulse points (neck, inside the wrists and elbows) and let dry without rubbing, for maximum duration. For external use only.\n0 88% Natural Origin Content OCEANIC AMBER FRESH EAU DE TOILETTE true"
    },
