      "Σύνθεση": "Υψηλή αρωματοποιία. Πολύπλοκο αλλά και ισορροπημένο. Κλασικό αλλά και σύγχρονο. Με έμπνευση τα αρώματα της Μεσογείου και με βάση τα υψηλής ποιότητας συστατικά. Όλα τα παραπάνω συνθέτουν το χαρακτήρα του αρώματος KORRES. Αρωματικές πυραμίδες που έχουν δημιουργηθεί σε συνεργασία με αρωματοποιούς από όλο τον κόσμο. Φόρμουλες που έχουν αναπτυχθεί από το δικό μας Εργαστήριο Ανάπτυξης: με φυσικό αντιοξειδωτικό από δενδρολίβανο, χωρίς PCM, phthalates και nitro-musks.",
      "Περιγραφή (EN)": "Eau De Toilette The fresh scent of the salty wind on the boat, the splashes on your face, escaping the city\nTop Notes: Lime, Mandarin, Orange\nHeart Notes: Marine, Watery, Pepper\nBase Notes: Cedar, Vetiver, Nutmeg\nMay contain traces of wheat / nuts\nALCOHOL DENAT., PARFUM/FRAGRANCE, AQUA/WATER/EAU, BRASSICA CAMPESTRIS (RAPESEED) SEED OIL, ROSMARINUS OFFICINALIS (ROSEMARY) LEAF EXTRACT, ALPHA-ISOMETHYL IONONE, BENZYL ALCOHOL, BENZYL SALICYLATE, CITRAL, CITRONELLOL, LIMONENE, LINALOOL.\n298 10 mL / 0.34 FL. OZ. Conscious yet premium. Complex yet balanced. Classic yet contemporary. Mediterranean-inspired. Fine ingredients-oriented. Dedicated to create fine perfumes with pure raw materials, working together with fragrance houses across the world. KORRES Fragrance is consciously made with natural antioxidant rosemary extract, without PCM, phthalates, and nitro-musks.\nEau De Toilette All skin types Suitable for Vegans As light rays strike the brown transparent glass bottle, an intriguing dance of shadows and amber reflections catches the eye. Minimal design, soft around the edges with a lab-inspired white top, it feels like holding a fragrance bottle of another era; an ode to simplicity of timeless quality. Wrapped in an all-white box, that tells the story of each KORRES scent through its notes.\n90% of our packaging across all our product lines is recyclable.\nAt KORRES we collect packaging waste and ensure it is transformed and reused. We wish to turn empties into beautiful recycled objects, offering them and us a second chance. Our Recycle Lab is fully operational in Greece, aspiring to expand across the globe.\nApply directly to skin on pulse points (neck, inside the wrists and elbows) and let dry without rubbing, for maximum duration. For external use only.\n0 87% Natural Origin Content KYMA FRESH EAU DE TOILETTE true"
