      "Περιγραφή (EN)": "Shower Gel Creamy - foam showergel, enriched with toning Olive leaf extract, cleanses gently and helps to maintain the natural hydration level of the skin. Ideal for everyday use.\nUse the showergel in a daily basis. Spead it softly at your wet skin in order to make enough foam. Rinse it out with a lot of water. Avoid the touch with the eyes.\nAQUA/WATER/EAU, SODIUM LAURETH SULFATE, COCAMIDOPROPYL BETAINE, SODIUM COCOYL ICOFFRETSHIONATE, COCO-GLUCOSIDE, GLYCERYL OLEATE, PARFUM/FRAGRANCE, ALOE BARBADENSIS LEAF JUICE POWDER, ARGININE, CASTORYL MALEATE GLYCERIN, GUAR HYDROXYPROPYLTRIMONIUM CHLORIDE, HYDROLYZED WHEAT GLUTEN, LACTIC ACID, OLEA EUROPAEA (OLIVE) LEAF EXTRACT, POLYQUATERNIUM-7, SODIUM CHLORIDE, SODIUM GLUCONATE, TOCOPHEROL, BENZYL ALCOHOL, IMIDAZOLIDINYL UREA, PHENOXYETHANOL, POTASSIUM SORBATE, SODIUM BENZOATE, SODIUM DEHYDROACETATE, ALPHA-ISOMETHYL IONONE, BENZYL SALICYLATE, HEXYL CINNAMAL, LIMONENE, LINALOOL.\n248 Crete is the largest and most fertile island of Greece, with an established, century-old tradition in οlive tree cultivation. Our products infused with οlive leaf extract are filled with local traditions, with the passion and know-how of local farmers on the island of Crete. Ιn the small village of Zounaki, Athanasia Papadantonaki is a pioneer herself, being among the first to adopt sustainable, organic οlive tree cultivation technics on the island. She provides us with hand-picked organic οlive leaves -a bi-product of οlive tree cultivation that would else be discarded and that has never been utilized up to this day.\n250 mL / 8.45 FL. OZ. Extra virgin οlive oil from world-renowned Cretan groves along with Cretan οlive leaf extract are the signature naturals of our Pure Greek Olive collection, including an extensive product line-up from skincare, showergels, body creams and shampoos to our best-selling 3in1 Nourishing Oil for face, body and hair. Skin feels deeply moisturized, soft, with increased elasticity and improved texture on first application, while hair looks healthy and feels silky shiny. Our Pure Greek Olive line is infused with fresh, gentle scents, reminiscent of οlive groves and picturesque Greek island yards.\nCleansing All skin types Suitable for Vegans Shower Gel Straight from the Zounaki village of Crete the οlive leaves are taken to our Extraction facility, after they have been dried naturally. We follow a 100% zero-waste extraction process, using exclusively natural solvents, while solid residue is composted to end up back into the soil as organic fertilizer.\nOur Cretan οlive leaf extract delivers toning properties.\nOlive green hues and an οlive tree illustration to remind us that the most powerful, yet pure, beauty secrets hide in nature. 90% of our packaging across all our product lines is recyclable. Paper packaging is FSC certified (Forest Stewardship Council). The ‘tree-tick’ symbol indicates that the paper has been sustainably sourced, ensuring forest growth, contributing to an overall ecosystem balance.\nAt KORRES we collect packaging waste and ensure it is transformed and reused. We wish to turn empties into beautiful recycled objects, offering them and us a second chance. Our Recycle Lab is fully operational in Greece, aspiring to expand across the globe.\nRub gently onto wet skin and rinse off with plenty of water. Avoid the touch with eyes. Ideal for daily use.\nDelivers velvet, healthy-looking skin instantly. 9 out of 10 people with dry skin who tried our Showergel, felt it smoother and refreshed, right after use.\nIn vivo self-evaluation test, panel of 32 people, ages 18-55\n0 89% Natural Origin Content OLIVE CLEANSING PURE GREEK OLIVE true"
