      "Περιγραφή (EN)": "Body Milk Body milk milk santorini grape with nourishing Almond Oil\n24H Nourish + Soften\nScent: A fresh, fruity aroma of juicy grapes,\nberries and violet with a hint of lime.\nSilky soft body milk, enriched with nourishing Greek Almond Oil,\nAloe and provitamin B5 that enhances skin suppleness\nand offers 24-hour moisturizing comfort.\nDermatologically Tested\nAQUA/WATER/EAU, CAPRYLIC/CAPRIC TRIGLYCERIDE, PRUNUS AMYGDALUS DULCIS (SWEET ALMOND) OIL, GLYCERIN, HYDROGENATED POLYDECENE, GLYCERYL STEARATE CITRATE, AMMONIUM ACRYLOYLDIMETHYLTAURATE/VP COPOLYMER, BUTYROSPERMUM PARKII (SHEA) BUTTER, DECYL COCOATE, ALOE BARBADENSIS LEAF JUICE POWDER, ASCORBYL PALMITATE, CAPRYLYL GLYCOL, CITRIC ACID, DISTARCH PHOSPHATE, GLYCINE SOJA (SOYBEAN) OIL, HELIANTHUS ANNUUS (SUNFLOWER) SEED OIL, LECITHIN, PANTHENOL, PHENYLPROPANOL, ROSMARINUS OFFICINALIS (ROSEMARY) LEAF EXTRACT, SODIUM GLUCEPTATE, TOCOPHEROL, BENZYL ALCOHOL, SODIUM BENZOATE, ANISE ALCOHOL, CAMPHOR, CINNAMYL ALCOHOL, CITRUS AURANTIUM PEEL OIL, CITRUS LIMON PEEL OIL, COUMARIN, DIMETHYL PHENETHYL ACETATE, GERANYL ACETATE, LIMONENE, LINALOOL, LINALYL ACETATE, PINENE, POGOSTEMON CABLIN OIL, PARFUM/FRAGRANCE, LACTIC ACID, SODIUM CITRATE.\n313 200 mL / 6.76 FL. OZ. Hydrate + Nourish All skin types 0 For external use only. Keep out of reach of children.\n0 92% Natural Origin Content SANTORINI GRAPE EVERYDAY HYDRATION BODY CREAMS & OILS & SCRUBS true"
