      "Χρήση": "Απλώστε επαρκή ποσότητα σε καθαρή επιδερμίδα καθημερινά ή μετά από την έκθεση στον ήλιο. Επαναλάβετε 2-3 φορές σε ιδιαίτερα αφυδατωμένο δέρμα.",
      "Σύνθεση": "To Aloe Vera After-Sun Ενυδατικό Γαλάκτωμα Σώματος χαρίζει ευχάριστη αίσθηση δροσιάς, θρέφει και ανακουφίζει το αφυδατωμένο από τον ήλιο δέρμα.",
      "Περιγραφή (EN)": "After Sun Lightweight moisturising body milk with fast-absorbing texture, ideal for use after sunbathing.\nPowered by Aloe Vera extract, avocado oil, calendula and vitamins. Refreshes, nourishes and conditions dehydrated skin after sun exposure.\nDermatologically tested\nKORRES works with Archipelagos Institute of Marine Conservation to reforest the underwater forests of the Aegean Sea; these Posidonia oceanica seagrass meadows have an essential role in the healthy longevity of our seas, while also contributing substantially to lowering the overall carbon footprint.\nAQUA/WATER/EAU, GLYCERIN, SORBITOL, COCOGLYCERIDES, GLYCERYL STEARATE CITRATE, ISODECYL NEOPENTANOATE, ORYZA SATIVA (RICE) BRAN OIL, ISOHEXADECANE, BUTYROSPERMUM PARKII (SHEA) BUTTER, PERSEA GRATISSIMA (AVOCADO) OIL, PARFUM/FRAGRANCE, PANTHENOL, AMMONIUM ACRYLOYLDIMETHYLTAURATE/VP COPOLYMER, CETYL ALCOHOL, ALOE BARBADENSIS LEAF JUICE POWDER, ALLANTOIN, ARGININE HCL, ASCORBIC ACID, ASCORBYL PALMITATE, BISABOLOL, BUTYLENE GLYCOL, CALENDULA OFFICINALIS FLOWER EXTRACT, CAPRYLYL GLYCOL, CHAMOMILLA RECUTITA (MATRICARIA) FLOWER EXTRACT, CITRIC ACID, CUCUMIS SATIVUS (CUCUMBER) FRUIT EXTRACT, HELIANTHUS ANNUUS (SUNFLOWER) SEED OIL, HYDROXYETHYL ACRYLATE/SODIUM ACRYLOYLDIMETHYL TAURATE COPOLYMER, LACTIC ACID, OLEA EUROPAEA (OLIVE) FRUIT OIL, ORNITHINE HCL, PEG-8, PHYTOSTEROLS, POLYSORBATE 60, SILICA, SIMMONDSIA CHINENSIS (JOJOBA) SEED OIL, SODIUM STEAROYL GLUTAMATE, SORBITAN ISOSTEARATE, SORBITAN OLEATE, TETRASODIUM GLUTAMATE DIACETATE, TOCOPHEROL, TOCOPHERYL ACETATE, TYROSINE, XANTHAN GUM, ZINGIBER OFFICINALE (GINGER) ROOT EXTRACT, BENZYL ALCOHOL, PHENOXYETHANOL, SODIUM DEHYDROACETATE.\n423 150 mL / 5.07 FL. OZ. The Aloe Vera After-Sun Body Milk refreshes, nourishes and conditions dehydrated skin after sun exposure.\nAfter Sun All skin types Suitable for Vegans Aloe extract, rich in vitamins C, E, zinc, antioxidant enzymes, provitamin B5 and avocado oil deeply hydrate and relieve from the burning sensation, while chamomile and calendula extracts soften and condition the skin. Biomolecules of natural aminoacids prolong natural suntan.\nForm, function and elegance, in our language; minimalist and modest, in full harmony with what makes natural beauty distinct. 90% of our packaging across all our product lines is recyclable.\nAt KORRES we collect packaging waste and ensure it is transformed and reused. We wish to turn empties into beautiful recycled objects, offering them and us a second chance. Our Recycle Lab is fully operational in Greece, aspiring to expand across the globe.\nApply sufficient quantity onto cleansed skin daily or after sun exposure. Repeat 2-3 times on very dehydrated skin.\nNourishment, comfort and sun-dehydrated skin' relief on first application. Excellent refreshing and cooling action.\nIn vivo self-evaluation test, panel of 32 people, ages 18-50\n0 84.4% Natural Origin Content ALOE VERA FACE HYDRATION AFTERSUN true"
