      "Περιγραφή (EN)": "Foaming Cleanser PROBIOTIC FOAMING CREAM CLEANSER\nPRE + PROBIOTICS\nCLEANSE + NOURISH\nThe one and only indulgent soap-free cream-to-foam cleanser for face and eyes, formulated with the ancient skin-soothing superfood Greek Yoghurt.\nMild surfactants melt away impurities and makeup while supporting the skin microbiome. Safe for even the most sensitive skin.\nPowered by:\nGREEK YOGHURT -\nAn ancient skin superfood that provides an instant cooling sensation while delivering probiotic extracts to nourish and comfort the skin.\nUPCYCLED OAT MILK -\nRich in polyphenols, b-glucan, and proteins, it is the ideal ingredient for sensitive skin.\nDoes not contain live microorganisms.\nDermatologically + ophthalmologically tested\nIdeal for sensitive skin.\nAQUA/WATER/EAU, COCO-BETAINE, SODIUM COCOYL ISETHIONATE, CETEARYL ALCOHOL, DISODIUM LAURYL SULFOSUCCINATE, ZEA MAYS (CORN) STARCH, GLYCERIN, SODIUM METHYL COCOYL TAURATE, SODIUM CHLORIDE, HYDROGENATED CASTOR OIL, MAGNESIUM ALUMINUM SILICATE, COCAMIDOPROPYL BETAINE, SCLEROTIUM GUM, ALPHA-GLUCAN OLIGOSACCHARIDE, AVENA SATIVA (OAT) MEAL EXTRACT, CAPRYLIC/CAPRIC TRIGLYCERIDE, CASTORYL MALEATE, CHLORELLA VULGARIS EXTRACT, CITRIC ACID, GLYCERYL LAURATE, GLYCERYL OLEATE CITRATE, HYDROLYZED RICE PROTEIN, LACTIC ACID, LACTOBACILLUS, LAMINARIA DIGITATA EXTRACT, LONICERA CAPRIFOLIUM (HONEYSUCKLE) FLOWER EXTRACT, LONICERA JAPONICA (HONEYSUCKLE) FLOWER EXTRACT, MALTODEXTRIN, MARIS AQUA/SEA WATER/EAU DE MER, PANTHENOL, PENTYLENE GLYCOL, PHENETHYL ALCOHOL, POLYMNIA SONCHIFOLIA ROOT JUICE, SACCHARIDE ISOMERATE, SODIUM COCOYL ALANINATE, SODIUM PHYTATE, YOGURT, YOGURT POWDER, CI 77891/TITANIUM DIOXIDE, BENZYL ALCOHOL, POTASSIUM SORBATE, SODIUM BENZOATE, PARFUM/FRAGRANCE, SODIUM HYDROXIDE.\n473 300 mL / 10.14 FL.OZ. Cleanse & Nourish All skin types 0 Rub gently into wet skin and rinse off with plenty of water.\n0 86.7% Natural Origin Content GREEK YOGHURT CLEANSING CLEANSERS & TONERS true"
