    "sections": {
      "Χρήση": "Ψεκάστε απευθείας στην επιδερμίδα στα σημεία των παλμών (λαιμός, εσωτερικό καρπών / αγκώνων) και αφήστε να στεγνώσει αποφεύγοντας την τριβή για τη μέγιστη διάρκεια και απόδοση του αρώματος. Για εξωτερική χρήση μόνο.\nΚίνδυνος: Υγρό και ατμοί πολύ εύφλεκτα. Μακριά από θερμότητα, θερμές επιφάνειες, σπινθήρες, γυμνή φλόγα και άλλες πηγές ανάφλεξης. Μην καπνίζετε. Μακριά από παιδιά. Για εξωτερική χρήση μόνο. Μην ψεκάζετε προς τα μάτια. Να μην χρησιμοποιείται για σκοπό άλλο από αυτόν για τον οποίο προορίζεται.",
      "Περιγραφή (EN)": "Eau De Toilette CITRUS | AMBERY\nAlong the mineral shores of Crete, shaped by sea salt and sun-warmed stone, an elemental freshness comes to life.\nIn CRETAN BLUE, sparkling bergamot, ginger, and a touch of sea salt open the fragrance with vibrant clarity. At the heart, powdery orris and soft rose bring refine texture, unfolding into a warm base of ambergris, tonka, and sandalwood.\nA fresh yet sensual composition inspired by the raw beauty of Crete’s coastal landscape.\nDiscover the rest Eau De Toilettes of the Blue Collection and explore Greece through its iconic shades of blue. IONIAN BLUE, AEGEAN BLUE, CRETAN BLUE.\n“Cretan Blue is the moment when the sea and sky become one.\nFor this creation, I wanted to capture something very specific: a peaceful, deep connection with the sky and the ocean. My inspiration was a sunny day in Greece, aboard a sailing boat.\nIn a surprising way, I have used Ambergris in combination with the freshness of Bergamot, Grapefruit, and a Sea Breeze accord.\nI wanted to express the tranquility of being under the sun, on board a sailing boat in Greece, admiring the immensity of the sea and listening to the waves crashing against the cliffs.”\nOlaf LARSEN - Master Perfumer at EUROFRAGANCE\nTOP NOTES: SEA SALT, BERGAMOT, GINGER\nHEART NOTES: ORRIS, ROSE\nBASE NOTES: AMBERGRIS, TONKA, SANDALWOOD\n0% PCM, Phthalate\n100% Natural Alcohol.\nDermatologically Tested.\nALCOHOL DENAT., AQUA/WATER/EAU, PARFUM/FRAGRANCE, TETRAMETHYL ACETYLOCTAHYDRONAPHTHALENES, BRASSICA CAMPESTRIS (RAPESEED) SEED OIL, ROSMARINUS OFFICINALIS (ROSEMARY) LEAF EXTRACT, ALPHATERPINENE, BETACARYOPHYLLENE, CITRAL, CITRUS AURANTIUM BERGAMIA PEEL OIL, COUMARIN, EUGENYL ACETATE, GERANIOL, GERANYL ACETATE, JUNIPERUS VIRGINIANA OIL, LIMONENE, LINALOOL, LINALYL ACETATE, PINENE, POGOSTEMON CABLIN OIL, ROSE KETONES, TERPINEOL, TERPINOLENE, VANILLIN.\n998 50mL /1.69 FL. OZ. Eau De Toilette All skin types Suitable for Vegans Spray directly to skin on pulse points (neck, inside the wrists and elbows) and let dry without rubbing, for maximum duration. For external use only.\nDanger: Highly flammable liquid and vapour. Keep away from heat, hot surfaces, sparks, open flames and other ignition sources. No smoking. Keep out of reach of children. External use only. Avoid spraying in eyes. Use for intended purpose only.\n0 89% Natural Origin Content EAU DE TOILETTE EAU DE TOILETTE true"
    },
