    "subtitle": "Top Notes: Lemon, Mandarin, Cardamon",
    "description": "Top Notes: Lemon, Mandarin, Cardamon\nHeart Notes: Mastic Tree Absolute, Orris\nBase Notes: Cashmere, Sandalwood\nΜπορεί να περιέχει ίχνη σίτου / ξηρών καρπών",
    "claims": [
      "Κατάλληλο για vegetarians"
    ],
    "highlights": [],
    "attributes": {
      "Τύπος δέρματος": "All skin types",
      "Ανάγκη": "Eau De Toilette",
      "Φυσικής προέλευσης": "87%",
      "Διαθέσιμα μεγέθη": "50ml",
      "Συσκευασία": "50ml"
    },
    "sections": {
      "Χρήση": "Ψεκάστε απευθείας στην επιδερμίδα στα σημεία των παλμών (λαιμός, εσωτερικό καρπών / αγκώνων) και αφήστε να στεγνώσει αποφεύγοντας την τριβή για τη μέγιστη διάρκεια και απόδοση του αρώματος. Για εξωτερική χρήση μόνο.\nΚίνδυνος: Υγρό και ατμοί πολύ εύφλεκτα. Μακριά από θερμότητα, θερμές επιφάνειες, σπινθήρες, γυμνή φλόγα και άλλες πηγές ανάφλεξης. Μην καπνίζετε. Μακριά από παιδιά. Για εξωτερική χρήση μόνο. Μην ψεκάζετε προς τα μάτια. Να μην χρησιμοποιείται για σκοπό άλλο από αυτόν για τον οποίο προορίζεται.",
      "Περιγραφή (EN)": "Eau De Toilette FLORAL | CITRUS | GREEN\nFrom the Greek island of Chios in the Aegean Sea comes mastic, a rare natural resin drawn from ancient trees and harvested by hand, drop by drop. Prized for centuries for its pure, aromatic character, it lies at the heart of AEGEAN BLUE.\nBright lemon and mandarin, lifted by a touch of cardamom, open the fragrance with fresh radiance. At the heart, mastic tree absolute blends with green tea and powdery orris, unfolding into a smooth base of cashmere woods, sandalwood, and musk.\nA fresh and absolute composition inspired by the timeless landscapes of the Aegean.\nDiscover the rest Eau De Toilettes of the Blue Collection and explore Greece through its iconic shades of blue. IONIAN BLUE, AEGEAN BLUE, CRETAN BLUE.\n“Aegean Blue feels like a holiday, the excitement of waking up at dawn to see the sun rise, the freshness of diving into the sea.\nIf my perfume were a shade of blue, it would be a serene, bright, sea of tranquility.\nI was particularly inspired by the mastic bushes that grow along the coastline and the mix of sea breeze with the crisp, green, resinous note of mastic.\nI used Mastic Absolute, which is quite a strong green note and I love the authentic freshness it brings to this composition.\nThe signature accord of this fragrance is built on a variety of citruses (Lemon Oil, Mandarin Oil, Orange Oil) with a very natural green tea accord that creates a crisp vibrant freshness.”\nOliver RIVA – Perfumer at TAKASAGO\nTOP NOTES: LEMON, MANDARIN, CARDAMON\nHEART NOTES: MASTIC TREE ABSOLUTE, ORRIS\nBASE NOTES: CASHMERE, SANDALWOOD\n0% PCM, Phthalate\n100% Natural Alcohol.\nDermatologically tested.\nALCOHOL DENAT., PARFUM/FRAGRANCE, AQUA/WATER/EAU, LINALYL ACETATE, BRASSICA CAMPESTRIS (RAPESEED) SEED OIL, ROSMARINUS OFFICINALIS (ROSEMARY) LEAF EXTRACT, ALPHATERPINENE, BENZYL BENZOATE, BETACARYOPHYLLENE, CITRAL, CITRONELLOL, CITRUS AURANTIUM PEEL OIL, CITRUS LIMON PEEL OIL, COUMARIN, EUCALYPTUS GLOBULUS OIL, EUGENOL, EUGENYL ACETATE, GERANIOL, GERANYL ACETATE, LIMONENE, LINALOOL, PINENE, ROSE KETONES, TERPINEOL, TERPINOLENE, TETRAMETHYL ACETYLOCTAHYDRONAPHTHALENES, TRIMETHYLCYCLOPENTENYL METHYLISOPENTENOL.\n998 50mL /1.69 FL. OZ. Eau De Toilette All skin types Suitable for Vegans Spray directly to skin on pulse points (neck, inside the wrists and elbows) and let dry without rubbing, for maximum duration. For external use only.\nDanger: Highly flammable liquid and vapour. Keep away from heat, hot surfaces, sparks, open flames and other ignition sources. No smoking. Keep out of reach of children. External use only. Avoid spraying in eyes. Use for intended purpose only.\n0 87% Natural Origin Content EAU DE TOILETTE EAU DE TOILETTE true"
    },
