    "sections": {
      "Οφέλη": "Άμεσα πιο λαμπερή και βελούδινα απαλή επιδερμίδα, με μία εφαρμογή.\nIn vivo τεστ αυτο-αξιολόγησης, 32 γυναίκες ηλικίας 18-40 ετών",
      "Χρήση": "Απλώστε το προϊόν σε μια επαρκή ποσότητα στο χέρι σας και κάντε απαλό μασάζ σε βρεγμένο σώμα με κυκλικές κινήσεις. Ξεπλύνετε με άφθονο, χλιαρό νερό. Σκουπίστε ταμποναριστά με μια πετσέτα και αμέσως μετά απλώστε στο σώμα σας ένα ενυδατικό προϊόν.",
      "Σύνθεση": "Απαλότητα + Λάμψη. Το Αναζωογονητικό Scrub Σώματος προσφέρει βαθύ καθαρισμό και άμεση λάμψη για όλο το σώμα, με ήπια δράση ιδανική και για τις ευαίσθητες επιδερμίδες. Χωρίς άρωμα, βασίζεται σε φυσικούς απολεπιστικούς παράγοντες από jojoba, bamboo και κουκούτσια ελιάς, και ένα ισχυρά ενυδατικό blend φυτικών ελαίων που διατηρούν τη φυσική υγρασία της επιδερμίδας, προσφέροντας αίσθηση φροντίδας και αναζωογόνησης. 100% όσων το δοκίμασαν, απόλαυσε πιο λαμπερή, απαλή, βελούδινη επιδερμίδα με υγιή όψη, χωρίς ξηρές περιοχές, από την πρώτη εφαρμογή.",
      "Περιγραφή (EN)": "Body Scrub A renewing scrub for the entire body, powered by a blend of physical exfoliators and ultra-nourishing natural oils, that sloughs away dead skin cells o­ffering a purifying spa experience.\nUnscented scrub\nDermatologically tested\nGLYCERIN, CELLULOSE ACETATE, BAMBUSA ARUNDINACEA STEM POWDER, COCOGLYCERIDES, OLEA EUROPAEA (OLIVE) FRUIT OIL, GLYCERYL CAPRYLATE, JOJOBA ESTERS, AQUA/WATER/EAU, ASCORBYL PALMITATE, BETA-CAROTENE, CARBOMER, DAUCUS CAROTA SATIVA (CARROT) ROOT EXTRACT, HELIANTHUS ANNUUS (SUNFLOWER) SEED OIL, LACTIC ACID, LECITHIN, LIMNANTHES ALBA (MEADOWFOAM) SEED OIL, OLEA EUROPAEA (OLIVE) SEED POWDER, PRUNUS AMYGDALUS DULCIS (SWEET ALMOND) OIL, SIMMONDSIA CHINENSIS (JOJOBA) SEED OIL, SODIUM HYDROXIDE, TOCOPHEROL, PHENOXYETHANOL.\n375 Right in the heart of the island of Crete, amidst a unique landscape there is Messara. We cooperate with the Organic Farmers Cooperative of Messara for the supply of Cretan extra virgin Olive oil of the predominant, supreme Koroneiki Olive variety. Founded back in the ‘90s by a small group of dedicated farmers, this is the first cooperative of its kind on the island that for decades has been trying to preserve this tradition, while promoting scientific research in relation to Olive tree organic cultivation methods.\n150 mL / 5.07 FL. OZ. Soft and radiant skin. A refreshing body scrub for deep cleansing and instant glow, ideal for sensitive skin too. An unscented formula based on natural scrub agents from jojoba, bamboo and olive stones and an extra moisturizing blend that helps maintain skin hydrations levels. 100% of volunteers who tried it, reported brighter, softer, velvet-like skin with healthy glow, without dry patches upon first application.\n0 With valleys at the foothills of mountains and very close to the sea, Crete has the ideal combination of microclimate, moisture and temperature conditions for the production of the best extra virgin Olive oil in the world. In the island' groves these slow-growing, organic Olive trees are watered naturally and kept small in size to be better nourished by the sun, offering a tiny, precious quantity of supreme \"green gold”. Our Cretan supreme Olive oil is produced at the certified facilities of the Organic Farmers Cooperative of Messara, using the pure cold-pressing method, free of additional refining treatments.\nNourishing extra virgin Olive oil is a natural source of Omega fatty acids, vitamins and polyphenols; it hydrates, nourishes skin deeply, while also locking in moisture, preventing transepidermal water loss and improving elasticity to maintain youthful skin that is refreshed and softened. In the scrub formula, it is part of a moisturizing blend that also includes jojoba, almond and carrot oils.\n90% recyclable packaging\nWe collect packaging waste and ensure it is transformed and reused. We wish to turn empties into beautiful recycled objects, offering them and us a second chance. Our Recycle Lab is fully operational in Greece, aspiring to expand across the globe.\nSpread a sufficient amount on your hands and gently massage all over your body, with circular movements. Rinse with plenty of warm water. Wipe with a large towel and before your skin is completely dry and apply a moisturizer or body oil that you liked.\nInstantly brighter, smoother, and ultra-velvet, soft skin; confirmed by 100% of women on first application.\nIn vivo self-evaluation test, 32 women, ages 18-40\n0 91.2% Natural Origin Content true"
    },
