      "Περιγραφή (EN)": "Multistick Balm A creamy multi-stick with effortless application: twist, glide, and blend for a healthy looking glow on-the-go. Infused with Paeonia Flower Extract and Shea Butter, it offers a dewy pop of color on cheeks and lips.\nHealthy Glow\nOn the Go\nPAEONIA FLOWER EXTRACT – Rich in fatty acids. Keeps skin moistured & refreshed\nSHEA BUTTER - Provides a super creamy & smooth texture. Product to melt upon contact with skin, crating a seamless result\n0% Silicones, Mineral Oil, Talc\nDermatologically Tested\nSuitable for Sensitive Skin\nFSC Paper Packaging\nNEOPENTYL GLYCOL DICAPRYLATE/DICAPRATE, PENTAERYTHRITYL TETRAISOSTEARATE, SYNTHETIC WAX, POLYBUTENE, MICA, SYNTHETIC FLUORPHLOGOPITE, SILICA, LAUROYL LYSINE, ETHYL VANILLIN, PENTAERYTHRITYL TETRA-DI-T-BUTYL HYDROXYHYDROCINNAMATE, CAPRYLIC/CAPRIC TRIGLYCERIDE, BUTYROSPERMUM PARKII BUTTER/BUTYROSPERMUM PARKII (SHEA) BUTTER, TIN OXIDE, BUTYROSPERMUM PARKII BUTTER UNSAPONIFIABLES/ BUTYROSPERMUM PARKII (SHEA) BUTTER UNSAPONIFIABLES, CRAMBE MARITIMA LEAF EXTRACT, PAEONIA OFFICINALIS FLOWER EXTRACT,\nMAY CONTAIN/PEUT CONTENIR [+/-]: CI 77891/TITANIUM DIOXIDE, CI 77491/IRON OXIDES.\n525 4.5 g / 0.15 0Z Healthy Glow All skin types Suitable for Vegans AS A BLUSH: Apply Natural Color Multi-stick Balm on the apples of your cheeks, blending outwards with your fingers or a brush. Set the outer edges with Natural Fresh Blush for all day-wear, while keeping the color at center of your cheeks more dewy and glowy.\nAS A HIGHLIGHTER: Use shade 02 Glass Peach, on top of the cheekbones, bridge of the nose and cupid’s bow, for a natural, lit-from-within glow. For a soft, luminous effect, blend lightly.\nAS A LIP TOPPER: For a quick, coordinated pop of color pat onto lips on top of your lipstick, or wear it alone for a more sheer result.\nSophia’s Tip: For a sun kissed look apply your multistick in shape of a W, start from one cheeck, go over the bridge of your nose, and end at your other cheek. Blend with your ﬁngers or a brush.\n0 45+% Natural Origin Content PAEONIA GLOW COMPLEXION true"
