    "claims": [],
    "highlights": [],
    "attributes": {
      "Τύπος δέρματος": "All skin types",
      "Ανάγκη": "Blush",
      "Φυσικής προέλευσης": "90+%"
    },
    "sections": {
      "Χρήση": "Εφαρμόστε με ένα πινέλο το Natural Fresh Blush στα μήλα των μάγουλών σας και αναμείξτε προς τα έξω. χρησιμοποιήστε το μαζί με το Natural Color Multi-stick Balm για να πετύχετε ένα ακόμα πιο λαμπερό αποτέλεσμα που διαρκεί όλη την ημέρα.\nSophia’s Tip: χρησιμοποιήστε ένα πιο σκούρο χρώμα γύρω από το πρόσωπο και ένα πιο ανοιχτό στα μήλα των ζυγωματικών.",
      "Περιγραφή (EN)": "Blush An ultra-creamy powder blush with velvety texture infused with Peony Flower Extract and Natural Origin Esters. Offers buildable finish for a healthy looking glow.\nHealthy Glow\nCreamy Touch\nPAEONIA FLOWER EXTRACT – Rich in fatty acids. Keeps skin moistured & refreshed\n26% NATURAL ORIGIN ESTERS - Skin-smoothing goodness. They take care of the skin and give an ultra-sensorial creamy texture to the product\nDermatologically Tested\nSuitable for Sensitive Skin\nFSC Paper Packaging\nMICA, CAPRYLIC/CAPRIC TRIGLYCERIDE, OCTYLDODECYL STEAROYL STEARATE, SILICA, STEARALKONIUM HECTORITE, ETHYLHEXYLGLYCERIN, DEHYDROACETIC ACID, LAUROYL LYSINE, PROPYLENE CARBONATE, TOCOPHEROL, PAEONIA OFFICINALIS FLOWER EXTRACT, MAY CONTAIN/PEUT CONTENIR [+/-]: CI 77891/TITANIUM DIOXIDE, CI 77491/IRON OXIDES, CI 77492/IRON OXIDES, CI 77499/IRON OXIDES, CI 19140/YELLOW 5 LAKE, CI 15850/RED 7 LAKE, CI 77007/ULTRAMARINES, CI 15850/RED 6, CI 15985/YELLOW 6 LAKE\n538 4.5 g / 0.15 0Z Blush All skin types Suitable for Vegans Apply Natural Fresh Blush on the apples of your cheeks, blending outwards with a brush. Use together with Natural Color Multi-stick Balm for a color that last all day and looks more dewy and glowy.\nSofia’s Tip: Use darker color around the perimeter of the face and a lighter on the apple piece of the cheeks.\n0 90+% Natural Origin Content PAEONIA NATURAL COVERAGE & GLOW COMPLEXION true"
    },
