      "Περιγραφή (EN)": "Nail Polish A nail polish that offers a chip resistant, high shine result. Infused with Sweet Almond Oil and Film-formers, it is a natural alternative to traditional nail polishes, without compromising results.\nGel Effect\nHigh Shine\nSWEET ALMOND OIL - Over 80% of ω-9 and ω-6 fatty acids. Nourishes & conditions nails\nFILM-FORMERS - Derived from cotton & corn. Give a super-shiny finish & let the nails breath.\nBUTYL ACETATE, ETHYL ACETATE, NITROCELLULOSE, ACETYL TRIBUTYL CITRATE, ALCOHOL, PROPYLENE GLYCOL/SEBACIC ACID/TRIMELLITIC ANHYDRIDE COPOLYMER, STEARALKONIUM BENTONITE, ISOPROPYL ALCOHOL, ADIPIC ACID/NEOPENTYL GLYCOL/TRIMELLITIC ANHYDRIDE COPOLYMER, N-BUTYL ALCOHOL, ALUMINUM HYDROXIDE, PHOSPHORIC ACID, DIETHYLHEXYL SODIUM SULFOSUCCINATE, AQUA/WATER/EAU, ALCOHOL DENAT., PRUNUS AMYGDALUS DULCIS OIL/PRUNUS AMYGDALUS DULCIS (SWEET ALMOND) OIL, SORBIC ACID, TOCOPHEROL, MAY CONTAIN/PEUT CONTENIR [+/-]: CI 15880/RED 34 LAKE, CI 77491/IRON OXIDES, CI 15850/RED 6 LAKE, CI 77891/TITANIUM DIOXIDE, CI 19140/YELLOW 5 LAKE, CI 77499/IRON OXIDES.\n248 11 mL / 0.37 FL.OZ. Nail Varnish All skin types Suitable for Vegans Step 1: Apply one coat of No No Nail Polish Base Coat.\nStep 2: Apply two coats of your preferred No No Nail Polish color.\nStep 3: Apply one coat of No No Nail Polish Top coat.\nAllow each coat to dry for 2-3 minutes.\nDanger: Highly flammable liquid and vapour. Keep away from heat, hot surfaces, sparks, open flames and other ignition sources. No smoking. Keep out of reach of children. External use only. Do not inhale.\n0 80+% Natural Origin Content SWEET ALMOND FULL COLOUR NAILS true"
