      "Χρήση": "Ανακινήστε καλά πριν την χρήση. Χρησιμοποιήστε ένα πινέλο ή τα δάχτυλά σας για να απλώσετε μια μικρή ποσότητα foundation. Ξεκινήστε από το κέντρο του προσώπου και αναμείξτε προς τα έξω με κυκλικές κινήσεις. Σιγουρευτείτε πως θα το απλώσετε καλά στην περιοχή του λαιμού και του πιγουνιού για ένα ομοιόμορφο αποτέλεσμα.\nSophia’s Tip: Χρησιμοποιήστε μια πιο σκούρα απόχρωση στη γραμμή του σαγονιού, στους κροτάφους, στη γραμμή των μαλλιών και στις κοιλότητες των μάγουλων για να τονίσετε τις γωνίες σας.",
      "Περιγραφή (EN)": "Liquid Foundation A lightweight sheer coverage foundation that delivers a natural luminous finish for the ideal bare skin effect. Enriched with refreshing Paeonia Flower extract, moisture-locking Glycerin and other Moisturizing agents for supreme hydration and instant, healthy-looking glow.\nBare Skin Effect\nInstant Radiant Glow\nNatural Luminous Finish\nPAEONIA FLOWER EXTRACT – Rich in fatty acids. Keeps skin moistured & refreshed.\nGLYCERIN – Hydration replenisher. It attracts water from the air and binds it onto the skin.\nOTHER MOISTURIZING AGENTS - Water-binding ingredients that keep skin's water levels balanced.\n0% Silicones, Mineral Oil, Talc\nDermatologically Tested\nSuitable for Sensitive Skin\nFSC Paper Packaging\nAQUA/WATER/EAU, DICAPRYLYL CARBONATE, UNDECANE, DICAPRYLYL ETHER, ISODODECANE, TRIDECANE, PENTYLENE GLYCOL, GLYCERIN, PROPANEDIOL, ZINC STEARATE, POLYGLYCERYL-6 POLYHYDROXYSTEARATE, POLYGLYCERYL-6 POLYRICINOLEATE, MAGNESIUM SULFATE, VERBASCUM THAPSUS EXTRACT, DISTEARDIMONIUM HECTORITE, POLYGLYCERIN-6, POTASSIUM SORBATE, HYDROGENATED LECITHIN, PARFUM/FRAGRANCE, PROPYLENE CARBONATE, CAPRYLIC/CAPRIC TRIGLYCERIDE, CITRIC ACID, STEARIC ACID, TOCOPHEROL, SODIUM BENZOATE, PAEONIA OFFICINALIS FLOWER EXTRACT, ASCORBYL PALMITATE, MAY CONTAIN/ PEUT CONTENIR [+/-]: CI 77891/TITANIUM DIOXIDE, CI 77492/IRON OXIDES, CI 77491/ IRON OXIDES, CI 77499/IRON OXIDES.\n663 30mL / 1.01 FL.OZ. Natural Coverage & Glow All skin types Suitable for Vegans Shake well before use. Then with a brush or your ﬁngers, apply a small amount of foundation. Start in the center of the face and blend outward using circular motions. Make sure to blend it well and smooth it properly around the neck and chin lines.\nSophia’s Tip: Use a darker shade on the jawline, temples, hairline, and cheek hollows to add definition\n95% Glowy, hydrated skin*\n85% Instant blurred appearance of imperfections and pores**\n95% Lightweight, comfortable wear*\n*% of women who tried KORRES Natural Sheer Foundation/ 4 hours after use/ Self-evaluation, 20 panelists between 18-40 years old\n**% of women who tried KORRES Natural Sheer Foundation/ Self-evaluation, 20 panelists between 18-40 years old\n0 95+% Natural Origin Content PAEONIA NATURAL COVERAGE & GLOW COMPLEXION true"
