      "Περιγραφή (EN)": "Bronzing Oil A satin touch, sun-protecting bronzing oil for an intense tan glow.\nEnriched with:\nUpcycled Carob Oil + Organic Carrot Oil, with natural warm hue to enhance the natural tanning result\nOrganic Coconut & Argan nourishing oils. Infused with the addictive vanilla Aegean Bronze signature scent for a sensual escape under the Aegean sun.\nFace + Body\nIdeal for a deep and uniform tan\nBroad spectrum UVA & UVB protection\nEnhanced natural tanning result\nSilky, non-greasy finish\nFor all skin types\nWater resistant\nDermatologically tested\nDICAPRYLYL ETHER, BUTYLENE GLYCOL DICAPRYLATE/DICAPRATE, DIBUTYL ADIPATE, TRIHEPTANOIN, ETHYLHEXYL PALMITATE, C13-15 ALKANE, SESAMUM INDICUM (SESAME) SEED OIL, PROPYLHEPTYL CAPRYLATE, UNDECANE, TRICAPRYLIN, SIMMONDSIA CHINENSIS (JOJOBA) SEED OIL, TRIDECANE, ETHYLHEXYL TRIAZONE, BIS-ETHYLHEXYLOXYPHENOL METHOXYPHENYL TRIAZINE, DIETHYLAMINO HYDROXYBENZOYL HEXYL BENZOATE, COCOS NUCIFERA (COCONUT) OIL, ARGANIA SPINOSA KERNEL OIL, BUTYL METHOXYDIBENZOYLMETHANE, BETA-CAROTENE, CAPRYLIC/CAPRIC TRIGLYCERIDE, CERATONIA SILIQUA (CAROB) SEED EXTRACT, DAUCUS CAROTA SATIVA (CARROT) ROOT EXTRACT, GLYCERYL CAPRYLATE, GLYCINE SOJA (SOYBEAN) OIL, HELIANTHUS ANNUUS (SUNFLOWER) SEED OIL, JUGLANS REGIA (WALNUT) SHELL EXTRACT, ROSMARINUS OFFICINALIS (ROSEMARY) LEAF EXTRACT, TOCOPHEROL, TOCOPHERYL ACETATE, SORBIC ACID, VANILLIN, PARFUM/FRAGRANCE.\n588 150 mL / 5.07 FL.OZ. Sun Tan All skin types 0 Shake before use. Do not spray directly on the face. Spray into hands before application. In case of direct contact with eyes, rinse immediately and thoroughly. Apply evenly onto body and face, avoiding the eye area, at least 30 minutes before exposure to the sun. Re-apply frequently to maintain protection, especially after perspiring, swimming, or toweling. In order to reach the protection level indicated by the sun protection factor, sunscreen products have to be applied in a quantity that is equal to 2mg/cm2 (approx. 6 teaspoons for the body of an average adult person).\nWarning: Not using the adequate quantity of sunscreen will lower the level of protection significantly. Do not stay too long in the sun, even while using a sunscreen product. Over-exposure to the sun is a serious health threat. Wait until the product is fully absorbed, before you get dressed. Sunscreen products may cause stains on clothing. Keep babies and young children out of direct sunlight.\nWarning: Not using the adequate quantity of sunscreen will lower the level of protection significantly. Do not stay too long in the sun, even while using a sunscreen product. Over-exposure to the sun is a serious health threat. Wait until the product is fully absorbed, before you get dressed. Sunscreen products may cause stains on clothing. Keep babies and young children out of direct sunlight.\n0 SUN TAN SUN TAN OILS true"
