    "sections": {
      "Χρήση": "Απλώστε απευθείας στην επιδερμίδα στα σημεία των παλμών (λαιμός, εσωτερικό καρπών / αγκώνων) και αφήστε να στεγνώσει αποφεύγοντας την τριβή για τη μέγιστη διάρκεια και απόδοση του αρώματος. Για εξωτερική χρήση μόνο.",
      "Σύνθεση": "Υψηλή αρωματοποιία. Πολύπλοκο αλλά και ισορροπημένο. Κλασικό αλλά και σύγχρονο. Με έμπνευση τα αρώματα της Μεσογείου και με βάση τα υψηλής ποιότητας συστατικά. Όλα τα παραπάνω συνθέτουν το χαρακτήρα του αρώματος KORRES. Αρωματικές πυραμίδες που έχουν δημιουργηθεί σε συνεργασία με αρωματοποιούς από όλο τον κόσμο. Φόρμουλες που έχουν αναπτυχθεί από το δικό μας Εργαστήριο Ανάπτυξης: με φυσικό αντιοξειδωτικό από δενδρολίβανο, χωρίς PCM, phthalates και nitro-musks.",
      "Περιγραφή (EN)": "Eau de Toilette Scent Identity: Floral, Oriental, Woody\nSweet, rejuvenating kumquat takes the lead in this sophisticated fragrance, followed by delicate notes of orange blossom and vanilla, sweet-sour fruits, sharp lemon and the earthy aura of cedar. All leaning against the sensual feel of luxurious cashmere.\nCashmere: The delicate, warm, indulgent feel of cashmere; praised as early as the third century BC, this synonym of luxury brings a sensual balance to this blend.\nKumquat: A bright orange color symbol of prosperity, with a bitter sweet aroma that evokes positive feelings; reminiscent of the first breeze in Mediterranean blossoming groves.\nVanilla: Derived from the seeds of tropical climbing orchid-like plants, the vanilla pod is believed to awaken the senses and induce dreams of love. A sublime ingredient with a distinctively sweet and seducing aroma and a long enduring reputation as one of nature’s most powerful aphrodisiacs.\nTop Notes: Kumquat, Mandarin, Orange\nHeart Notes: Orange Blossom, Jasmine, Almond\nBase Notes: Cashmere, Cedarwood, Vanilla\nALCOHOL DENAT., AQUA/WATER/EAU, PARFUM/ FRAGRANCE, BENZYL SALICYLATE, BRASSICA CAMPESTRIS (RAPESEED) SEED OIL, HELIANTHUS ANNUUS (SUNFLOWER) SEED OIL, ROSMARINUS OFFICINALIS (ROSEMARY) LEAF EXTRACT, ALPHA-ISOMETHYL IONONE, COUMARIN, GERANIOL, LINALOOL.\n298 10 mL / 0.34 FL. OZ. Conscious yet premium. Complex yet balanced. Classic yet contemporary. Mediterranean-inspired. Fine ingredients-oriented. Dedicated to create fine perfumes with pure raw materials, working together with fragrance houses across the world. KORRES Fragrance is consciously made with natural antioxidant rosemary extract, without PCM, phthalates, and nitro-musks.\nEau De Toilette All skin types Suitable for Vegans As light rays strike the brown transparent glass bottle, an intriguing dance of shadows and amber reflections catches the eye. Minimal design, soft around the edges with a lab-inspired white top, it feels like holding a fragrance bottle of another era; an ode to simplicity of timeless quality. Wrapped in an all-white box, that tells the story of each KORRES scent through its notes. 90% of our packaging across all our product lines is recyclable.\nAt KORRES we collect packaging waste and ensure it is transformed and reused. We wish to turn empties into beautiful recycled objects, offering them and us a second chance. Our Recycle Lab is fully operational in Greece, aspiring to expand across the globe.\nApply directly to skin on pulse points (neck, inside the wrists and elbows) and let dry without rubbing, for maximum duration. For external use only.\n0 88% Natural Origin Content CASHMERE KUMQUAT FLORAL EAU DE TOILETTE true"
    },
