      "Σύνθεση": "Kρέμα-Gel ελαφριάς υφής για σύσφιγξη πόρων και ισορροπημένη ενυδάτωση. Εμπλουτισμένη με εκχύλισμα από Σταφύλι Σαντορίνης θρεπτικό και πλούσιο σε αντιοξειδωτικά, πολυφαινόλες και τανίνες, χάρη στο ηφαιστειογενές έδαφος όπου καλλιεργείται, βοηθά στη ρύθμιση της λιπαρότητας και μειώνει την εμφάνιση των πόρων. Με 90,8% Περιεχόμενο Φυσικής Προέλευσης προσφέρει ματ αποτέλεσμα από την 1η χρήση* + βελτίωση της όψης των πόρων μέσα σε 14 ημέρες**\n*72% των γυναικών που δοκίμασαν KORRES Santorini Grape Poreless Κρέμα-Gel / Τεστ Αυτοαξιολόγησης, 32 εθελοντές ηλικίας 18-35 ετών\n** 97% των γυναικών που δοκίμασαν KORRES Santorini Grape Poreless Kρέμα-Gel/ Τεστ Αυτοαξιολόγησης, 32 εθελοντές ηλικίας 18-35 ετών",
      "Περιγραφή (EN)": "Face Gel Cream A lightweight cream that clears the way for poreless-looking skin with antioxidant rich, Santorini Grape for balanced, all-day hydration.\nPowered by:\nSANTORINI GRAPE EXTRACT - From the volcanic ash in which it grows, rich in antioxidants and condensed tannins that help to remove excess oil and reduce the appearance of pores.\nSALICYLIC ACID - A BHA that exfoliates by removing dead skin cells, unclogging and refining pores. May contain traces of wheat / nuts.\nDermatologically tested\nAQUA/WATER/EAU, GLYCERIN, SIMMONDSIA CHINENSIS (JOJOBA) SEED OIL, C12-15 ALKYL BENZOATE, DICAPRYLYL CARBONATE, AMMONIUM ACRYLOYLDIMETHYLTAURATE/VP COPOLYMER, DICAPRYLYL ETHER, MACADAMIA INTEGRIFOLIA (MACADAMIA) SEED OIL, POTASSIUM CETYL PHOSPHATE, VITIS VINIFERA (GRAPE) FRUIT EXTRACT*, ACRYLATES/C10-30 ALKYL ACRYLATE CROSSPOLYMER, ASCORBYL PALMITATE, CALENDULA OFFICINALIS EXTRACT, CAPRYLYL GLYCOL, CITRIC ACID, CYCLODEXTRIN, EPILOBIUM\nFLEISCHERI FLOWER/LEAF/STEM EXTRACT, GLYCERYL STEARATE, GLYCINE SOJA (SOYBEAN) OIL, HELIANTHUS ANNUUS (SUNFLOWER) SEED OIL, LACTIC ACID, OLEA EUROPAEA (OLIVE) FRUIT OIL, PANTHENOL, PERSEA GRATISSIMA (AVOCADO) OIL, PHYTOSTEROLS, PUNICA GRANATUM FRUIT EXTRACT, ROSMARINUS OFFICINALIS (ROSEMARY) LEAF EXTRACT, SODIUM GLUCEPTATE, SODIUM HYALURONATE, SODIUM HYDROXIDE, SORBITAN OLEATE, TOCOPHEROL, TOCOPHERYL ACETATE, TROXERUTIN, PHENOXYETHANOL, POTASSIUM SORBATE, SALICYLIC ACID, SODIUM BENZOATE, PARFUM/FRAGRANCE.\n*KORRES SANTORINI GRAPE FRUIT EXTRACT\nAQUA/WATER/EAU, GLYCERIN, SIMMONDSIA CHINENSIS (JOJOBA) SEED OIL, C12-15 ALKYL BENZOATE, DICAPRYLYL CARBONATE, AMMONIUM ACRYLOYLDIMETHYLTAURATE/VP COPOLYMER, DICAPRYLYL ETHER, MACADAMIA INTEGRIFOLIA (MACADAMIA) SEED OIL, POTASSIUM CETYL PHOSPHATE, VITIS VINIFERA (GRAPE) FRUIT EXTRACT*, ACRYLATES/C10-30 ALKYL ACRYLATE CROSSPOLYMER, ASCORBYL PALMITATE, CALENDULA OFFICINALIS EXTRACT, CAPRYLYL GLYCOL, CITRIC ACID, CYCLODEXTRIN, EPILOBIUM\nFLEISCHERI FLOWER/LEAF/STEM EXTRACT, GLYCERYL STEARATE, GLYCINE SOJA (SOYBEAN) OIL, HELIANTHUS ANNUUS (SUNFLOWER) SEED OIL, LACTIC ACID, OLEA EUROPAEA (OLIVE) FRUIT OIL, PANTHENOL, PERSEA GRATISSIMA (AVOCADO) OIL, PHYTOSTEROLS, PUNICA GRANATUM FRUIT EXTRACT, ROSMARINUS OFFICINALIS (ROSEMARY) LEAF EXTRACT, SODIUM GLUCEPTATE, SODIUM HYALURONATE, SODIUM HYDROXIDE, SORBITAN OLEATE, TOCOPHEROL, TOCOPHERYL ACETATE, TROXERUTIN, PHENOXYETHANOL, POTASSIUM SORBATE, SALICYLIC ACID, SODIUM BENZOATE, PARFUM/FRAGRANCE.\n*KORRES SANTORINI GRAPE FRUIT EXTRACT\n598 Powerful Santorini Grape, a white grape variety which contains extremely high concentration of polyphenols; a vine variety raised with no water in the volcanic soil of Santorini island, sprayed by the Aegean sea mist water and shaped by the harsh island winds. The Santorini grape cultivation is unique in the world; close to the ground in the shape of a basket, protecting the grapes inside from winds and sunlight, while locking-in the essential sea mist water. It’s the greatest example of self-renewal in nature, a grape variety with a distinct, natural sweet aroma, sustainably grown like no other grape in the world.\n40 mL/1.35 FL.OZ. A lightweight cream that clears the way for poreless-looking skin with antioxidant rich Santorini Grape for balanced, all-day hydration. With a 90.8% Natural Origin Content, the Poreless Skin Cream provides a mattifying effect from the 1st use* and helps to refine pore appearance in 14 days**\n*72% of women who tried KORRES Santorini Grape Poreless Cream / Self-assessment, 32 panelists between 18-35 years old\n**97% of women who tried KORRES Santorini Grape Poreless Cream / Self-assessment, 32 panelists between 18-35 years old\nSmooth & Balance Oily - Combination Skin Suitable for Vegans Through upcycling, we obtain our cosmetic extract by sourcing the marcs, which are the by-products of cultivation, from the Union of Santorini Cooperatives/Santowine. This marks the first time that the great volume of Santorin Grape vinification by-products is not discarded, but rather used to produce a cosmetic extract. After the marcs have been dried for 48 hours under the bright Greek sun, we extract them using only natural solvents following a 100% zero-waste process. Any solid residue is composted and upcycled into organic fertilizer, returning to the soil to nourish the very crops from which the marcs were derived. The valuable Greek Grape extract is incorporated in our Santorini Grape skincare collection.\nPowered by Santorini Grape extract, from the volcanic acid in which it grows, rich in antioxidants and tannins helps to remove excess oil and reduce the appearance of pores. Salicylic Acid, an oil-soluble BHA naturally found in the willow tree, has the ability to penetrate through sebum and oil thus it effectively refines pores, making them less visible and tighter. Ιt gently exfoliates the skin, revealing a baby-smooth and radiant complexion while helping control sebum production and excess oiliness. Infused with Hyaluronic Acid, the gold standard in hydration, able to hold 1000 times its weight in water, it increases and locks-in hydration and helps diminish moisture-loss resulting in more plump skin.\nCapturing Santorini’s island unique landscape, vibrant grape visuals sourced from its distinctive vineyards reflect the pure allure of Greece's natural beauty.\n90% of our packaging across all our product lines is recyclable.Paper packaging is FSC certified (Forest Stewardship Council). The ‘tree-tick’ symbol indicates that the paper has been sustainably sourced, ensuring forest growth, contributing to an overall ecosystem balance.\nAt KORRES we collect packaging waste and ensure it is transformed and reused. We wish to turn empties into beautiful recycled objects, offering them and us a second chance. Our Recycle Lab is fully operational in Greece, aspiring to expand across the globe.\nAfter cleansing, apply to the face and neck, avoiding the eye area.\n1.Softens/Refines pore appearance in 14 days*\n*97% of women who tried KORRES Santorini Grape Poreless Cream / Self-assessment, 32 panelists between 18-35 years old.\n2.Has a mattifying effect from 1st use*\n*72% of women who tried KORRES Santorini Grape Poreless Cream / Self-assessment, 32 panelists between 18-35 years old.\n3.100% of women felt smoothed out skin texture*\n*100% of women who tried KORRES Santorini Grape Poreless Cream / Use for 14 days/ Self-assessment, 32 panelists between 18-35 years old.\n0 90.8% Natural Origin Content SANTORINI GRAPE RETEXTURE MOISTURIZERS true"
