      "Χρήση": "Μετά το ντουζ ή το μπάνιο σας, απλώστε το προϊόν σε όλο σας το σώμα κάνοντας παράλληλα ελαφρύ μασάζ. Περιμένετε λίγο μέχρι να απορροφηθεί από την επιδερμίδα προτού ντυθείτε.",
      "Περιγραφή (EN)": "Body Cream Moisturising body cream enriched with extra virgin Olive oil, a natural source of vitamins and antioxidants and toning Olive leaf extract. With lightweight texture, it is easily absorbed, leaving the skin nourished and soft.\nDermatologically tested\nAQUA/WATER/EAU, CAPRYLIC/CAPRIC TRIGLYCERIDE, GLYCERIN, PRUNUS AMYGDALUS DULCIS (SWEET ALMOND) OIL, HYDROGENATED POLYDECENE, GLYCERYL STEARATE CITRATE, AMMONIUM ACRYLOYLDIMETHYLTAURATE/VP COPOLYMER, BUTYROSPERMUM PARKII (SHEA) BUTTER, DECYL COCOATE, ALOE BARBADENSIS LEAF JUICE POWDER, ALTHAEA OFFICINALIS ROOT EXTRACT, CAPRYLYL GLYCOL, CITRIC ACID, DISTARCH PHOSPHATE, GLYCINE SOJA (SOYBEAN) OIL, LACTIC ACID, MAGNESIUM PCA, MANGANESE PCA, OLEA EUROPAEA (OLIVE) FRUIT OIL, OLEA EUROPAEA (OLIVE) LEAF EXTRACT, PANTHENOL, ROSMARINUS OFFICINALIS (ROSEMARY) LEAF EXTRACT, SODIUM GLUCEPTATE, SODIUM PCA, ZINC PCA, PHENOXYETHANOL, POTASSIUM SORBATE, SODIUM BENZOATE, BENZYL SALICYLATE, CITRONELLOL, COUMARIN, GERANIOL, LIMONENE, LINALOOL, PARFUM/FRAGRANCE.\n338 200 mL / 6.76 FL. OZ. Hydration All skin types 0 After your shower or bath, apply the product all over your body while doing a light massage. Wait a while until it is absorbed by the skin before getting dressed.\n100% of women felt their skin instantly nourished, supple and softer upon application, enjoying an overall healthy-looking skin*.\nIn vivo self-evaluation test, 32 women, ages 18-55\n*Following one month of use\n0 92.7% Natural Origin Content OLIVE EVERYDAY HYDRATION PURE GREEK OLIVE true"
