      "Χρήση": "Χρησιμοποιήστε καθημερινά το αφρόλουτρο στο ντους ή στο μπάνιο σας. Απλώστε αρκετή ποσότητα με απαλές κυκλικές κινήσεις σε βρεγμένο δέρμα και δημιουργήστε αφρό. Ξεπλύνετε με άφθονο νερό. Αποφύγετε την επαφή με τα μάτια.",
      "Περιγραφή (EN)": "Shower Gel Creamy – foam showergel, enriched with toning Olive leaf extract, cleanses gently and helps to maintain the natural hydration level of the skin. Ideal for everyday use.\nAQUA/WATER/EAU, SODIUM LAURETH SULFATE, COCAMIDOPROPYL BETAINE, SODIUM COCOYL ISETHIONATE, COCO GLUCOSIDE, GLYCERYL OLEATE, PARFUM/FRAGRANCE, ALOE BARBADENSIS LEAF JUICE POWDER, ARGININE, CASTORYL MALEATE, CITRIC ACID, GLYCERIN, GUAR HYDROXYPROPYLTRIMONIUM CHLORIDE, HYDROGENATED PALM GLYCERIDES CITRATE, HYDROLYZED WHEAT GLUTEN, LACTIC ACID, OLEA EUROPAEA OLIVE LEAF EXTRACT, POLYQUATERNIUM 7, SODIUM CHLORIDE, SODIUM GLUCONATE, TOCOPHEROL, BENZYL ALCOHOL, IMIDAZOLIDINYL UREA, PHENOXYETHANOL, POTASSIUM SORBATE, SODIUM BENZOATE, SODIUM DEHYDROACETATE, BENZYL SALICYLATE, EUCALYPTUS GLOBULUS OIL, LINALOOL, LINALYL ACETATE, TETRAMETHYL ACETYLOCTAHYDRONAPHTHALENES, SODIUM HYDROXIDE.\n248 250 mL / 8.45 FL.OZ. Cleansing All skin types 0 Rub gently onto wet skin and rinse off with plenty of water. Avoid the touch with eyes. Ideal for daily use.\nDelivers velvet, healthy-looking skin instantly. 9 out of 10 people with dry skin who tried our Showergel, felt it smoother and refreshed, right after use.\nIn vivo self-evaluation test, panel of 32 people, ages 18-62\n0 85.1% Natural Origin Content OLIVE CLEANSING + HYDRATION PURE GREEK OLIVE true"
