      "Περιγραφή (EN)": "Anti-Ageing Day Cream Tinted SPF 20 A rose-tinted moisturizer with SPF 20 that gives a rejuvenated, firmer look to post-menopausal skin. With Meno-Reverse™ technology and Ocean Light Complex it revives skin’s healthy, rosy glow.\nDermatologically tested.\nPowered by:\nWHITE PINE - KORRES’ proprietary ingredient powerfully improves the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles.\nMENO-REVERSE™ TECHNOLOGY - Natural peptide blend derived from artichoke leaves, clinically proven to improve the skin’s volume and reduce the appearance of sagging.\nOCEAN LIGHT COMPLEX - A blend of sand lily extract and oceanic polysaccharides that awakens skin’s natural radiance and youthful look. USE: Apply to the face and neck, avoiding the eye area.\nAQUA/WATER/EAU, DIBUTYL ADIPATE, BUTYLENE GLYCOL DICΑPRYLATE/DICAPRATE, ETHYLHEXYL SALICYLATE, GLYCERIN, BIS-ETHYLHEXYLOXYPHENOL METHOXYPHENYL TRIAZINE, PROPANEDIOL, UNDECANE, TRIS-BIPHENYL TRIAZINE (NANO), CETEARYL ALCOHOL, CAPRYLIC/CAPRIC TRIGLYCERIDE, POLYMETHYL METHACRYLATE, PEG-100 STEARATE, TRIDECANE, AVENA STRIGOSA SEED EXTRACT, BISABOLOL, BUTYLENE GLYCOL, CITRIC ACID, CYNARA SCOLYMUS (ARTICHOKE) LEAF EXTRACT, DECYL GLUCOSIDE, DICAPRYLYL CARBONATE, DISODIUM CETEARYL SULFOSUCCINATE, DISODIUM PHOSPHATE, ETHYLHEXYL TRIAZONE, ETHYLHEXYLGLYCERIN, ISOPROPYL TITANIUM TRIISOSTEARATE, LACTIC ACID, LECITHIN, LONICERA CAPRIFOLIUM (HONEYSUCKLE) FLOWER EXTRACT, LONICERA JAPONICA (HONEYSUCKLE) FLOWER EXTRACT, MICA, PANCRATIUM MARITIMUM EXTRACT, PINUS HELDREICHII BARK EXTRACT*, POLYGLYCERYL-3 CAPRATE, SACCHARIDE ISOMERATE, SILICA, SODIUM CARBOXYMETHYL BETA-GLUCAN, SODIUM POLYACRYLATE, SPILANTHES ACMELLA FLOWER EXTRACT, SYNTHETIC FLUORPHLOGOPITE, TETRASODIUM GLUTAMATE DIACETATE, TIN OXIDE, TOCOPHEROL, TOCOPHERYL ACETATE, XANTHAN GUM, ZINGIBER OFFICINALE (GINGER) ROOT EXTRACT, CI 77491/IRON OXIDES, CI 77492/IRON OXIDES, CI 77891/ TITANIUM DIOXIDE, PHENOXYETHANOL, POTASSIUM SORBATE, SODIUM BENZOATE, ALPHA-ISOMETHYL IONONE, BENZYL SALICYLATE, CITRONELLOL, COUMARIN, HEXYL CINNAMAL, LINALOOL, PARFUM/FRAGRANCE.\n*KORRES WHITE PINE EXTRACT\n1048 At 1.075 years old, Adonis with its Greek Mythology-inspired name, is the oldest known tree in Europe; a symbol of divine beauty and nature, this is the oldest out of a group of pines discovered by an international research team on the highest peaks of Pindus Mountains. This is a White Pine tree. Its exact location remains still a well-kept secret.The spine of Greece, as the Pindus Mountains are often referred to, is a national treasure host to some of the rarest plants of the country. Where Black Pine forests end, the White Pine trees start growing. This perennial tree has an amazing surviving power, conquering Pindus highest tops of up to 2,500m height. Under the guidance of the Directorate of Forests of Grevena, KORRES sources by-products of White Pine timber production, that would else be discarded.\n40 mL / 1.35 FL. OZ. Breakthrough formulations that target all signs of mature skin after menopause with eight out of ten women confirming their skin felt just like pre-menopause skin. After menopause lipid levels and the reproductive capacity of cells drop by 30% and 36% respectively, while within the following 5 years, 30% of collagen is simply lost. Skin thins and becomes more sensitive. Deep wrinkles, visible signs of sagging, intense dryness, rough texture, dullness, ageing spots are all signs of post-menopause skin.Our White Pine collection improves skin volume, sagging and age spots; it plumps skin, improving the appearance of deep wrinkles; it comforts dryness. Nine out of ten women confirmed deeply nourished skin on first application, deep wrinkles’ appearance reduction in just 1 month and a plump, radiant skin with improved volume. Intense hydration, firming, increased density and a sense of skin comfort throughout the day were common features of the White Pine skincare experience for all women who tried it.\nPost Menopause Mature Skin MENO-REVERSE™ Suitable for Vegans Through a 100% zero-waste process, KORRES attains high quality extracts, using exclusively natural solvents. Solid residue is composted to end back into the soil as organic fertilizer. The White Pine extract was used for the first time in a cosmetic formula by KORRES that introduced this powerful Greek antiaging ingredient to the global cosmetic ingredient bible (WINCI).\nThe White Pine collection is powered with Meno-Reverse™ technology with targeted action on post-menopause ageing. A breakthrough natural peptide blend derived from artichoke leaves that helps skin return to its pre-menopause look and feel. It restores vital water levels, clinically proven to improveskin’s volume, dryness, rough texture and reduce the appearance of sagging and deep wrinkles.KORRES’ over ten-year quest for the time-defying secret of perennial trees, led to the Pindus Mountains in Greece. This is where we discovered White Pine -yet another potent natural antiageing treasure hidden in the abundant Greek nature. Primary research in cooperation with the Department of Pharmacy and the Department of Biology of the National University of Athens proved that White Pine extract has a strong antioxidant profile and whitening properties, hence targeting multiple antiageing mechanisms related to post-menopause skin. The KORRES White Pine extract deriving from the tree’s bark, a rich source of polyphenols, enhances elasticity, firms, decreases the appearance of deep wrinkles, increases skin’s resilience and minimizes the appearance of age spots.\nSimple, minimal packaging with White Pine creatively depicted on one side and with silver tones reminiscent of the majestic silver tree barks standing tall on the highest peaks of Pindus Mountains in Greece. 90% recyclable packaging. Paper packaging is FSC certified (Forest Stewardship Council); the ‘tree-tick’ symbol indicates that the paper has been sustainably sourced, ensuring forest growth and contributing to an overall ecosystem balance.\nAt KORRES we collect packaging waste and ensure it is transformed and reused. We wish to turn empties into beautiful recycled objects, offering them and us a second chance. Our Recycle Lab is fully operational in Greece, aspiring to expand across the globe.\nApply to the face and neck, avoiding the eye area.\n8 out of 10 women confirmed their skin felt just like pre-menopause*. Reduced appearance of deep wrinkles and dark spots in 4 weeks. Softer, nourished skin and comfortable feel through the day on first application.\nIn vivo self-evaluation test, 32 women, ages 55-70\n*Following two months of use.\n0 WHITE PINE POST MENOPAUSE MOISTURIZERS true"
