    "description": "Φρέσκο, απαλό καλοκαιρινό ξύπνημα.\nTop Notes: Watermelon, Freesia, Bamboo\nHeart Notes: Mimosa, Lotus Flower, Salty Notes\nBase Notes: Cedarwood, Sandalwood, Musk",
    "claims": [],
