    "sections": {
      "Χρήση": "Απλώστε το σαμπουάν σε βρεγμένα μαλλιά και κάνετε ελαφρύ μασαζ. Ξεβγάλτε και επαναλάβετε. Να μη χρησιμοποιείται για παιδιά κάτω των 3 ετών.",
      "Σύνθεση": "Σαμπουάν, conditioners, μάσκες και προϊόντα styling βασίζονται σε εξελιγμένες φόρμουλες -χωρίς σιλικόνες. Ενισχύουν τη φυσική άμυνα του τριχωτού και εξασφαλίζουν την υγιή εμφάνιση των μαλλιών, μέσα από κλινικά αποδεδειγμένη δράση: πιο απαλά, λαμπερά μαλλιά με υγιή όψη για 9 στις 10 γυναίκες με ξηρά ή βαμμένα μαλλιά, σε μόλις 14 ημέρες*. In vivo μελέτη** σε πάνελ γυναικών με αυξημένες απαιτήσεις φροντίδας μαλλιών (λιπαρό τριχωτό και ταλαιπωρημένα, ελαφρά κατεστραμμένα μακριά μαλλιά) κατέγραψε αυξημένη ενυδάτωση του τριχωτού κατά 28% και μείωση του σμήγματος κατά 44% σε τέσσερις εβδομάδες. Η σειρά καλύπτει κάθε πιθανή ανάγκη περιποίησης του τριχωτού της κεφαλής: ενυδάτωση, επανόρθωση, ενδυνάμωση τρίχας, λάμψη, ελαστικότητα, εύκολο χτένισμα, “ασπίδα” από περιβαλλοντικές επιθέσεις και άλλους εξωγενείς παράγοντες, όπως οι τεχνικές διεργασίες.\n*Κλινική δοκιμή αυτο-αξιολόγησης (32 γυναίκες με ξηρά μαλλιά) / Αμύγδαλο + Λινάρι Σαμπουάν για ξηρά + αφυδατωμένα μαλλιά / Ηλίανθος + Τσάι του βουνού Μάσκα για βαμμένα μαλλιά\n**In vivo μελέτη υπό την επίβλεψη εξειδικευμένου δερματολόγου / Χρήση του σαμπουάν KORRES 3 φορές/εβδομάδα για διάστημα 4 εβδομάδων",
      "Περιγραφή (EN)": "Anti Hair Loss Shampoo For Men Tonic shampoo that gently cleanses and strengthens hair at its root.\nMay contain traces of wheat / nuts\nDermatologically tested\nAQUA/WATER/EAU, SODIUM LAURETH SULFATE, SODIUM COCOAMPHOACETATE, BETAINE, ACHILLEA MILLEFOLIUM EXTRACT, BIOTIN, BUTYLENE GLYCOL, CINCHONA SUCCIRUBRA BARK EXTRACT, CITRIC ACID, COCO-GLUCOSIDE, COPPER GLUCONATE, DECYL GLUCOSIDE, DICAPRYLYL ETHER, ETHYLHEXYLGLYCERIN, FAEX/YEAST EXTRACT/EXTRAIT DE LEVURE, GLYCERIN, GLYCERYL OLEATE, GLYCOPROTEINS, GUAR HYDROXYPROPYLTRIMONIUM CHLORIDE, HYDROGENATED PALM GLYCERIDES CITRATE, INULIN, LACTIC ACID, LACTITOL, LAURETH-2, MAGNESIUM ASPARTATE, NIACINAMIDE, ORIGANUM DICTAMNUS FLOWER/LEAF/ STEM EXTRACT, ORIGANUM MAJORANA LEAF EXTRACT, PANICUM MILIACEUM SEED EXTRACT, PANTHENOL, PEG-90 GLYCERYL ISOSTEARATE, PENTYLENE GLYCOL, POLYQUATERNIUM-10, SIDERITIS SYRIACA EXTRACT, SODIUM ACETATE, SODIUM CHLORIDE, SODIUM GLUCONATE, TETRASODIUM DISUCCINOYL CYSTINE, TOCOPHEROL, TRITICUM VULGARE (WHEAT) GLUTEN, TUSSILAGO FARFARA (COLTSFOOT) FLOWER EXTRACT, XYLITOL, ZINC GLUCONATE, BENZOIC ACID, BENZYL ALCOHOL, DEHYDROACETIC ACID, PHENOXYETHANOL, POTASSIUM SORBATE, SALICYLIC ACID, SODIUM BENZOATE, SORBIC ACID, PARFUM/FRAGRANCE, ALCOHOL.\n398 Crete is the largest and most fertile island of Greece, with a long-standing tradition in aromatic and medicinal plant cultivation. Our haircare collection is infused with three of the most powerful Cretan herbs. Marjoram, cultivated in the small town of Arkalochori for decades, along with two renowned endemic plants of Greece, native to Crete’s highest peaks; Dittany, prevailing in Cretan abundant nature, and Malotira, else known as mountain tea, naturally growing on Lefka Ori at 1,000m altitude. All sustainably cultivated.\n400 mL / 13.53 FL. OZ. Hair reset with Cretan herbs. Our silicone-free hair collection -including shampoos, conditioners, masks and a styling gel- is based on advanced formulations with highly efficacious natural actives, delivering on all fronts: moisturizing, antioxidant protection, hair repair, elasticity, shine, manageability and detangling, protection from environmental damage and chemical processing. Nine out of ten women with dry or coloured hair enjoyed softer, shiny, healthy-looking hair in just 14 days*. Additional in vivo study** focusing on one of the most challenging scalp + hair types -oily scalp, damaged hair- showed 28% increased skin moisturization and 44% skin sebum decrease in four weeks.\n**Clinical trial / Self-evaluation (panel of 32 women with dry hair) | Almond + Linseed Shampoo for dry + damaged hair / Sunflower + Mountain Tea Repairing Mask for coloured hair\n**In vivo study supervised by specialized dermatologist (panel of 20 women) | Use of KORRES Shampoo 3 times/week for 4 weeks\nHair Loss For hair loss Suitable for Vegetarian Powerful Dittany, Marjoram and Malotira extracts derive from the fresh, blooming aerial parts of the plants, through a 100% zero-waste process, using exclusively natural solvents, to sustain their antioxidant properties. Solid residue is composted to end up back into the soil as organic fertilizer.\nScalp and hair against environmental factors and hair-loss. Dittany, a source of lipids, flavonoids and terpenoids, has been highly valued for its medicinal properties since antiquity. Its antioxidant action is owed to the high concentration of phenolic substances. Equally powerful, Marjoram is fueled with vitamins, carotin and thymol, improving hair texture. Among the most popular plants in folk medicine, Malotira’ leaves and flowers contain terpenoids, flavonoids and sterols; all substances with a potent antioxidant profile. This complex is further boosted with vitamin B3 and provitamin B5 -part of the B-B complex- that are essential nutrients helping restore and maintain healthy-looking hair. Additionally, an innovative technology, specific to KORRES Shampoos, that is powered by the synergistic action of two 100% natural complex systems with moisturising and softening properties, focuses on the overall scalp and hair’ healthy appearance both short and long term\nForm, function and elegance, in our language; minimalist and modest, in full harmony with what makes natural beauty distinct.\nWe use 90% of our packaging across all our product lines is recyclable across our product portfolio.\nAt KORRES we collect packaging waste and ensure it is transformed and reused. We wish to turn empties into beautiful recycled objects, offering them and us a second chance. Our Recycle Lab is fully operational in Greece, aspiring to expand across the globe.\nApply onto damp hair, massage gently and rinse. Shampoo again and rinse thoroughly. Not to be used for children under 3 years of age.\n0 91.5% Natural Origin Content CYSTINE & MINERALS HAIR LOSS SHAMPOOS true"
    },
